摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"An LLM-driven Minecraft bot that beats the Ender Dragon. Rust + Azalea protocol client, 44 tools, 23-tier task system.","id":"gh:1319280640","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"seeker-craft","slug":"XJungit/seeker-craft","topics":["ai-agent","azalea","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","game-ai","llm","minecraft","minecraft-bot","rust"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"An LLM-driven Minecraft bot that beats the Ender Dragon. Rust + Azalea protocol client, 44 tools, 23"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"craft bot that beats the Ender Dragon. Rust + Azalea protocol client, 44 tools, 23-tier task system."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# SeekerCraft (Craft-Agent)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English | 中文**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**An LLM-driven Minecraft bot that beats the Ender Dragon. Rust + Azalea protocol client, no mods, n"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"o screenshots — a real protocol-level player that observes, plans, and executes through typed tools."},{"id":"p4s3","text":"screenshots — a real protocol-level player that observes, plans, and executes through typed tools.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| **Core question** | Can an LLM autonomously survive, craft, and defeat the Ender Dragon from nothi"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ng? |\n| **Runtime** | Pure Rust client via Azalea (MC 26.2), no server mods |\n| **Brain** | Any Open"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"AI-compatible LLM (DeepSeek cache-optimized); DSH (DeepSeek Harness) bridge mode as of 2026-08-14 |\n"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"| **Scale** | 5 crates, 49 LLM Tools, 23 structured tasks, 10 reactive modes, spatial memory |\n| **D"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ev loop** | Autonomous: gap analysis → fix → probe verify → commit (workflow notes kept locally, not"},{"id":"p5s6","text":" Autonomous: gap analysis → fix → probe verify → commit (workflow notes kept locally, not shipped) |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Project nature.** This project is produced through AI-assisted development\n> (\"vibe coding\") as "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"a personal experiment — deliberately adopting a Rust-only\n> toolchain the author had never used. Imp"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"lementation draws on\n> Mindcraft (JS + mineflayer, reference\n> for tasks/profiles/modes) and Azalea."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Real protocol client** — joins as a vanilla player via the Azalea Rust client (MC 26.2), built-i"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"n pathfinding; no mods, no screenshots.\n- **49 typed LLM tools** — perceive, goto, mine, craft (2x2/"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"3x3/smelt/enchant/brew), place, build, containers, trading, combat, meta-tools.\n- **10 reactive mode"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"s** — self-defense, hunting, auto-pickup, torch-placing, unstuck, elbow-room, etc., running tick-lev"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"el without LLM latency (bot-side; LLM posture switched via `set_mode`).\n- **Structured task system**"},{"id":"p8s6","text":" — 23 tiered tasks (wood → stone → iron → diamond → netherite → ender dragon) with machine-checkable"},{"id":"p8s7","text":" completion conditions.\n- **Spatial WorldMemory** — chunk-indexed memories (resources, structures, c"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"ontainers, hazards, portals) with TTL forgetting and named anchors.\n- **DSH bridge mode** — since 20"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"26-08-14 the in-bot LLM loop is removed; DSH (DeepSeek Harness) is the sole brain driving the bot th"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"rough the viewer bridge (`/api/connect` + `/api/bot_tool` + `/api/game-state` + `/api/goal`).\n- **Pr"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"obe mode** — a no-LLM tool-layer test harness that verifies tool behavior in seconds (not minutes of"},{"id":"p8s12","text":" LLM runtime).\n- **Ops console (`craft-agent-ctl`)** — process lifecycle, goal injection, session in"},{"id":"p8s13","text":"spection (DSH is the sole brain)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The bot runs live in Minecraft, driven by DSH (DeepSeek Harness) as its brain; the\ncraft-agent-viewe"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"r dashboard shows the real-time state."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Bot running (DSH brain + live dashboard) | Dashboard (full view) | Dashboard button in DSH |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> **azalea dependency**: the manifest declares the maintained fork `XJungit/azalea`\n> (`craft-agent`"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" branch) as an https source with a pinned rev — upstream main lacks the\n> archery/equipping APIs. `v"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"endor/azalea` is the local offline mirror (submodule); during\n> development a gitignored `.cargo/con"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"fig.toml` `[patch]` redirects to it. **Fresh clones\n> compile without that patch.** Fork-update work"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"flow: see ARCHITECTURE.md."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### DSH bridge runtime (since 2026-08-14)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> **The in-bot 13-step agent loop was removed** (2026-08-14, phase-3 cleanup): `run_one_turn`,\n> aut"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"o-perceive, SelfPrompter, execute_batch, and per-turn dynamic-context injection no longer\n> exist in"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" Rust. The brain (DSH) now owns decision/planning/context-injection/system-prompt\n> stability; Rust "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"only exposes real-time bot capabilities through the viewer bridge.\n> See ARCHITECTURE.md for details"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"nly exposes real-time bot capabilities through the viewer bridge.\n> See ARCHITECTURE.md for details."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## The 6-stage path to beating the dragon"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Tier | Stage | Tasks |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| 1 | **Wood & tools** | gather wood, crafting table, wooden pickaxe, stone pickaxe |\n| 2 | **Iron a"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ge** | furnace, iron pickaxe |\n| 3 | **Survival gear** | bread, iron armor, iron sword, shield |\n| 4"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" | **Diamond age** | diamond pickaxe/sword/armor, mine to bedrock |\n| 5 | **Nether & magic** | encha"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"nting table, enchant sword, brewing stand, nether portal |\n| 6 | **Finale** | netherite ingot/pickax"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"e, shulker box, elytra, ender dragon |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"All 23 tasks (6 tiers) ship as machine-checkable JSON in `data/tasks/`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Current Progress (2026-09-25 · v1.6.3)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Verified end-to-end (live server, no mods):**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Stage | Status | Evidence |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Tier 1–2: wood → stone → iron pickaxe chain | ✅ live | bot autonomously gathered wood, crafted pla"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"nks/sticks/pickaxes, and crafted an iron pickaxe via a nearby crafting table |\n| Tier 3: survival ge"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ar | ✅ live | full iron armor equipped + diamond sword + shield; HP/hunger fully recovered |\n| Tier "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"4: diamond age | ✅ live | bot followed the Y-layer hint (mine_below to Y≤16), descended to the diamo"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"nd layer (Y=-59), located and mined diamond_ore with `search_for_block`; full diamond armor equipped"},{"id":"p25s6","text":" |\n| Tier 5: nether & magic | 🔄 in progress | **nether portal built** (obsidian frame + flint_and_st"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"eel ignition, visible in world memory as `nether_portal`); enchanting / brewing being worked |\n| Tie"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"r 6: finale | ⬜ pending | netherite / shulker / elytra / ender dragon |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Milestones recently shipped (v1.0.0 release baseline):**"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **v1.0.0 (2026-08-15)** — 1.0 release: DSH bridge mode is the only supported usage (one-shot setup"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"/start/stop scripts +\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### 1. Prerequisites"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Dependency | Notes |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| **Rust nightly** | Pinned `nightly-2026-07-21` in `rust-toolchain.toml` (azalea needs nightly; sta"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ble fails) |\n| **Git** | For cloning the repo and submodules |\n| **Node.js ≥ 20 + pnpm** | For the D"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"SH bridge plugin |\n| **Minecraft Java 26.2 server** | Bring your own vanilla server (LAN is fine); b"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ot connects to `localhost:4444` by default |\n| **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** | Bring your own install ("},{"id":"p30s5","text":"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness); this repo only generates the craft-bot preset |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"> **Why DSH is not bundled**: DSH is the external \"brain\" (the same harness you code with);\n> bundli"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ng it would duplicate the whole toolchain and pin a version. You install DSH once;\n> `setup.ps1` the"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"n registers the craft-bot preset into your existing `~/.dsh`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
